        "title": "专访DeepMind前核心科学家Andrew Dai：在谷歌做AI的14年、Gemini翻身之战，与视觉理解模型【硅谷101视频播客】",
        "link": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1JCLw61E2d",
        "image": "https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/bf69a0acc14822c6be39d4db69fdedf81b8d0db8.jpg",
        "publishedAt": "2026-05-19T03:00:00.000Z",
